sequenceDiagram
  actor K as Klien
  actor P as Pelamar
  participant FE as React
  participant API as Express
  participant DB as MySQL

  K->>FE: post lowongan
  FE->>API: POST /api/mp/lowongan
  API->>DB: jobs OPEN is_active 1

  P->>FE: kirim lamaran
  FE->>API: POST /lowongan/:id/lamar
  API->>DB: applications PENDING
  API-->>FE: notifikasi ke klien
  Note over K,API: setelah ada pelamar, edit lowongan dikunci
